# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": "local"
}

### update note through legacy route
PUT {{host}}/api/notes/{{note}}
Content-Type: text/markdown
Cookie: {{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

# Manual Legacy Test

Updated through /api/notes.

### invalid path
PUT {{host}}/api/notes/%2E%2E/secret.md
Content-Type: text/markdown
Cookie: {{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

# Should fail

### non-markdown path
PUT {{host}}/api/notes/notes/manual-legacy.txt
Content-Type: text/plain
Cookie: {{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

Should fail

### unauthenticated
PUT {{host}}/api/notes/{{note}}
Content-Type: text/markdown
Cookie: lirox_session=invalid

# Should fail
